    "detailed_description": "A masterless ninja receives the last offer to regain his honor and be accepted among his peers: eliminate the demon wizard king from the lands of the distant west and conquer that territory for his former daimyo.<br><br><strong>Characteristics:</strong><br><br>8-bit pixel art graphics<br>original soundtrack<br>handmade levels<br>rewarding gameplay<br>miscellaneous collectibles<br><br><strong>Controls:</strong><br><br>keyboard:<br>movement - arrow keys<br>main attack - &quot;X&quot;<br>select sub weapon - space<br>sub weapon attack - &quot;C&quot;<br><br>gamepad:<br>movement - arrow keys or left analog stick<br>jump - &quot;A&quot;<br>main attack - &quot;X&quot;<br>select sub weapon - &quot;Y&quot; or right sholder button<br>sub weapon attack - &quot;B&quot;",
    "about_the_game": "A masterless ninja receives the last offer to regain his honor and be accepted among his peers: eliminate the demon wizard king from the lands of the distant west and conquer that territory for his former daimyo.<br><br><strong>Characteristics:</strong><br><br>8-bit pixel art graphics<br>original soundtrack<br>handmade levels<br>rewarding gameplay<br>miscellaneous collectibles<br><br><strong>Controls:</strong><br><br>keyboard:<br>movement - arrow keys<br>main attack - &quot;X&quot;<br>select sub weapon - space<br>sub weapon attack - &quot;C&quot;<br><br>gamepad:<br>movement - arrow keys or left analog stick<br>jump - &quot;A&quot;<br>main attack - &quot;X&quot;<br>select sub weapon - &quot;Y&quot; or right sholder button<br>sub weapon attack - &quot;B&quot;",
